forklift patch 0001 (PR 7a-2, docs/design/2026-11-25-real-sources-pr7.md 4): the SDK keeps each scan buffer's last sample
time beside its first (grabScanDataHqWithTimeStamps), and the node publishes each scan also on 'scan_sdk', stamped with
the first sample (CLOCK_MONOTONIC as it is, no ROS clock), scan_time = last - first sample of the same buffer and the
frame_id suffixed '@sdk_mono_v1' (the format's name); 'publish_delay_ms' (bench only) holds a read scan before it is
published. Against Slamtec/sllidar_ros2 34300099; applied with git apply in deploy/ros2/Dockerfile.scan.

